*    GS_DROP_0100-VALUE   =  LS_SCARR-CARRID && ':' && LS_SCARR-CARRNAME.
**    GS_DROP_0100-VALUE   =  LS_SCARR-CARRNAME .
*    APPEND  GS_DROP_0100 TO GT_DROP_0100.
